## Visual Studio / .NET Ignore Rules
## ==================================

# Build results
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio temporary files, caches, and user-specific configuration
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.dbmdl
*.jfm
*.launchSettings.json.user

# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/

# Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
*.sln.docstates

# Secrets & Environment variables
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets.json

# Local Uploaded Static Files (preserve directory structure but ignore local uploads)
**/wwwroot/ProductsImages/*
!**/wwwroot/ProductsImages/.gitkeep

# Windows / OS temporary files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.DS_Store
